==Battleground==
*1 [[Kyuubei]] (1,200%) spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kyuubei]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Kyuubei]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**20 [[Kyuubei]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 2~2.67 seconds<sup>60f~80f</sup>.
**10 [[Kyuubei]]s (1,200%) spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Kyuubei]]s (10,000%) spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using any units that have [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|wave attacks]] or [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attacks]] are ideal for this stage.

If properly upgraded, you can use any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] on this stage.

